flowchart TD

    A([Start]) --> B[Declare hardwareDebugMode]

    B --> C{justWokeUp}

    C -- Yes --> D{Wakeup cause is TIMER}
    D -- Yes --> E[Exit sleep]
    D -- No --> F{Wakeup cause is EXT0}
    E --> F
    F -- Yes --> G[Exit sleep]
    F -- No --> H[Clear justWokeUp flag]
    G --> H
    H --> I([Return])

    C -- No --> J[Get current time]

    J --> K{Debug switch HIGH}

    K -- Yes --> L[Set hardwareDebugMode true]
    L --> M[Handle OTA client]
    M --> N[Print debug message]

    K -- No --> O[Set hardwareDebugMode false]

    N --> P[Update OLED active state]
    O --> P

    P --> Q{In sleep mode}

    Q -- Yes --> R[Delay 100 ms]
    R --> S([Return])

    Q -- No --> T[Print sending data packet]
    T --> U[Send data packet]
    U --> V[Delay 2000 ms]
    V --> W[Print turning on 1 wire board]
    W --> X[Power on DS2484]
    X --> Y[Delay 10 ms]
    Y --> Z[Read and transmit all probes]
    Z --> AA[Receive variables from receiver]

    AA --> AB{Hardware debug mode}

    AB -- Yes --> AC[Reset allReadingsSent flag]
    AC --> AD[Delay 500 ms]
    AD --> AE([End])

    AB -- No --> AF{All readings sent}

    AF -- No --> AD

    AF -- Yes --> AG{OLED currently active}

    AG -- Yes --> AH[Delay 5000 ms]
    AH --> AI[Enter sleep]
    AI --> AJ([Return])

    AG -- No --> AI
